## Document W3C JSON-LD as a first-class standard

Context:
Phase 1 JSON-LD interop landed in code; product-facing docs still presented
OntoBricks as OWL/Turtle-first. Surface JSON-LD as an explicit W3C standard in
the README, architecture, product, user guide, Help Center, About page, and
Sphinx API overview so operators and agents discover the format.

Changes:

1. README.md
   Standards bullet and GitHub-mirror note now cite W3C JSON-LD with API/MCP usage.
2. docs/architecture.md
   Stack table, Key Standards (new JSON-LD section), External Standards table,
   References, and Supporting W3C standards list.
3. docs/product.md, docs/user-guide.md, docs/getting-started.md
   Import/export formats and standards bridge copy include JSON-LD.
4. docs/sphinx/index.rst, overview/architecture.rst, api/app.core.w3c.rst
   Sphinx overview and W3C API page document Turtle/JSON-LD serialization helpers.
5. src/front/templates/partials/layout/help_modal.html
   Glossary entry, W3C resources links (JSON-LD + SPARQL), FAQ, export hint.
6. src/front/templates/about.html
   Capabilities list and Resources link to JSON-LD 1.1.

